<div class="columnArticleClass two-layout-bg-white" id="oneColumnArticleTheme"><div id="sectionHeadingForOneColumnArticle"><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Why SIPROTEC 7SJ66?</span></h2></div></div></div></div></div><div class="text-start container multitextblock "><div class="row justify-content-left"><div class="col col-md-8"><p>SIPROTEC 7SJ66 provides multifunctional protection, control and monitoring for high and medium voltage networks. Safeguard asynchronous motors and offer backup for transformer differential protection.</p><p>Electrical networks and motors need reliable protection for stability. SIPROTEC 7SJ66 includes flexible protection functions. Customize up to 20 functions to meet your specific requirements for precise control of circuit breakers.</p><p>Adapt protection to your network needs with functions like rate-of-frequency-change or reverse power protection. Use the integrated graphical logic editor (CFC) to implement automation functions. Integrate the device into modern communication networks through interfaces for efficient data exchange and system oversight.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div id='67y9RsVZ9L62zYVYa0v8hl' class='sitesThreeColTiles themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='three-col-tiles_2' data-ste-section-id='67y9RsVZ9L62zYVYa0v8hl'>
