<div><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Key benefits</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container three-column-tile"><div class="row"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Improve reliability" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Improve reliability</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Implement comprehensive protection for high and medium voltage networks, motors, and backup. Automate switchgear operations with your defined logic for interlocking.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Reduce downtime" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Reduce downtime</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Monitor operational values, energy metering and circuit-breaker wear. Access 8 oscillographic fault records for detailed analysis and use this data to manage assets, reduce downtime and extend equipment lifespan.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Streamline integration" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Streamline integration</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Integrate the device into modern communication networks using standard protocols. Exchange data easily for improved system interoperability.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id='36U26IGVtWLX4IGka5TfeK' class='sitesCardsContainer themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='cards-container_3' data-ste-section-id='36U26IGVtWLX4IGka5TfeK'><is-land on:visible><div id="comp-36U26IGVtWLX4IGka5TfeK" class="CardsContainer" data-