abindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Communication%20protocols%20and%20interfaces-1-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Communication protocols and interfaces</h3><div id="G_Communication%20protocols%20and%20interfaces-1-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Connect your device using protocols like IEC 61850, DNP TCP and Modbus RTU. Utilize electrical and optical interfaces with RSTP for redundancy. Integrate into modern networks for reliable data exchange.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Custom logic and automation" id="G_Custom%20logic%20and%20automation-2" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Custom%20logic%20and%20automation-2-title" aria-describedby="G_Custom%20logic%20and%20automation-2-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Custom%20logic%20and%20automation-2-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Custom logic and automation</h3><div id="G_Custom%20logic%20and%20automation-2-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Implement your own functions using the integrated graphical logic editor (CFC). Control circuit breakers and switching devices with user-defined logic. Automate switchgear, including interlocking.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><template data-island><script type="module" src="/shared-assets/1f5459c4589ce8f899743c2f1031e839981f40d9/lib/helpers/esm/index.module.js"></scrip